From 5b744e6046cb0fae036c12c148b2aa23755d77cf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Phoenix gpu-lane <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 05:48:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] xfree86: allow a framebuffer-slot probe in builds without
 libpciaccess

xf86PostProbe() aborts with "Cannot run in framebuffer mode. Please
specify busIDs for all framebuffer devices" when a framebuffer slot was
claimed together with a slot on a real bus (PCI, SBus, platform).  Without
XSERVER_LIBPCIACCESS the PCI term of that test was the constant TRUE, so
*any* framebuffer-slot claim was fatal: a driver's legacy Probe() -- the
only probe path when the server has neither libpciaccess nor udev (no
platform bus), e.g. modesetting on an SoC with Option "kmsdev" -- could
never bring up a screen, and no BusID can help because the test does not
look at one.  xf86ClaimFbSlot() already refuses a framebuffer slot once a
bus slot is claimed; with no PCI support no PCI slot can exist, so the term
is FALSE.

Seen on Phoenix-RTOS (-Dpciaccess=false -Dudev=false): modesetting's
Probe() claimed /dev/dri/card0 and the server exited in xf86PostProbe().
---
 hw/xfree86/common/xf86Bus.c | 8 +++++++-
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/hw/xfree86/common/xf86Bus.c b/hw/xfree86/common/xf86Bus.c
index fd144db..21b9414 100644
--- a/hw/xfree86/common/xf86Bus.c
+++ b/hw/xfree86/common/xf86Bus.c
@@ -556,6 +556,12 @@ xf86GetDevFromEntity(int entityIndex, int instance)
 void
 xf86PostProbe(void)
 {
+    /*
+     * Fatal only when a framebuffer slot and a slot on a real bus were both
+     * claimed.  Without libpciaccess no PCI slot can have been claimed, so the
+     * PCI term is FALSE -- it used to be TRUE, which made every legacy
+     * (framebuffer-slot) probe fatal in builds without PCI support.
+     */
     if (fbSlotClaimed && (
 #if (defined(__sparc__) || defined(__sparc)) && !defined(__OpenBSD__)
                              sbusSlotClaimed ||
@@ -566,7 +572,7 @@ xf86PostProbe(void)
 #ifdef XSERVER_LIBPCIACCESS
                              pciSlotClaimed
 #else
-                             TRUE
+                             FALSE
 #endif
         ))
         FatalError("Cannot run in framebuffer mode. Please specify busIDs "
-- 
